PREREQ is an independent, unofficial visualization tool.

Course codes, titles, credit values and requirement facts are attributed to
Sabanci University's official public SUIS catalog. Snapshot observations and
links are documented in docs/SOURCES.md and in the data records themselves.
The MIT software license does not claim ownership of the university's name,
trademarks, course descriptions or source documents. No university logos,
photographs, faculty contact lists, full course descriptions, credentials,
private user screenshots or third-party font files are included.

The visual structure was inspired by a user-supplied screenshot of an
expandable OSINT catalog. No source code, branding or graphic assets were
copied from that tool.
